  "title": "Adversarial Attacks on Autonomous Driving Vision-Language Models: A CVPR 2026 Challenge",
  "summary": "This report presents the CVPR 2026@AdvML Workshop Challenge on adversarial multimodal attacks against autonomous-driving VLAs, highlighting how image-side attacks are favored by suffix penalties, scene-level multi-view optimization is more effective, and typographic content in camera images exposes persistent vulnerabilities. The challenge evaluates model robustness across diverse VLMs.",
